            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Safer updates (Sparkle 2.10.1, which includes two security fixes). The notch comes back after the Mac sleeps. The dictation HUD now shows over full-screen apps. Clear all on the shelf. IntelliJ, PyCharm, WebStorm and other JetBrains IDE sessions show up as Claude Code sessions. A new installer window.
]]></description>
