            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Keys you saved in 1.0.1 move to the renamed Keychain entry on their own. Tidier GitHub project (own issue templates, no inherited funding link), a website, and a daily watcher for new releases of the projects Tuckr is built on.
]]></description>
