            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[First Tuckr release: new name and icon, a welcome tour with the permissions, a chat with Mochi (double-click the Agents tab) and his quick settings (right-click it), a month calendar (tap the month), scrolling in the teleprompter, Russian and 24 other languages in the Transcribe panel, a quick switch for replacing macOS banners, signed automatic updates, and privacy hardening.
]]></description>
